# Route: guide 35 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 53 to 55, 24
# quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Felwood): Jaedenar -> Felpaw Village -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Deadwood
# Village -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Deadwood Village -> Felpaw Village ->
# Emerald Sanctuary -> Jaedenar -> Ruins of Constellas -> Jaedenar -> Shatter
# Scar Vale -> Irontree Woods -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 4109 Salve via
# Mining; 4110 Salve via Gathering; 4111 Salve via Skinning; 4112 Salve via
# Disenchanting; 5888 Salve via Mining; 5889 Salve via Gathering; 5890 Salve
# via Skinning; 5891 Salve via Disenchanting; 6032 Sacred Cloth.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

